# Dream Coat replaces a creature's colors with one chosen color, for no mana, and the change persists (CR 611.2a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Dream Coat
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Dream Coat.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Hand.Dream Coat.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Coat.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Modes(Count: 0)
Bot1.Modes(Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Coat.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Red
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Coat.Activate
Bot1.Modes(Blue; Green)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Blue; Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Coat.Activate
Bot1.Modes(White; Blue; Black; Red; Green)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Coat.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Black; Blue; Green; Red; White
